==Description==
'''The32 Nametag''' is a nametag that could be obtained at Level 23 of the premium [[Hexscape Event#Hexscape Event Battle Pass|Hexscape Event Battle Pass]] track. At that Level, it costed {{CandyCorns|740 Candy Corns}} or {{Robux|176}} ({{Robux|132}} for the Black Friday 2024 Sale) to unlock it, with a total cost of {{CandyCorns|8,210 Candy Corns}} or {{Robux|1,742}} ({{Robux|1,311}} for the Black Friday 2024 Sale).

'''The32 Nametag''' has black-purple gradient text surrounded by a glitchy black mist. Purple and yellow particles as well as the number "32" similar to that of the [[32]] sticker can be seen glitching behind the text.

