==Trivia==
*This nametag is a reference to the 32 meme from the Tower Defense Simulator community, which started due to the number initially being thought to be a clue to activation of the [[Hidden Wave]].
**This number got referenced multiple times before, such as in the [[v1.32.0]] in-game update log.

